"text": "[image: Herrera Breaks $600K in First Half of Q3, Reserves $1.7 Million Ad Buy] Press Releases Herrera Breaks $600K in First Half of Q3, Reserves $1.7 Million Ad Buy In the first forty-five days of the third quarter, Herrera has raised more money than Katy Stout has during her entire campaign. San Antonio, TX — Since the July 1st start of the third quarter, Brandon Herrera has raised over $600,000 for his campaign committees. This includes $544,459.60 raised by the Brandon Herrera Victory Fund, […] Read More Posted August 17, 2026",
"href": "https://brandonherreraforcongress.com/news/press-releases/herrera-breaks-600k-in-first-half-of-q3-reserves-1-7-million-ad-buy/"
},
