"text": "[image: Herrera Response to Big Bend Construction] Press Releases Herrera Response to Big Bend Construction San Antonio, TX — Brandon Herrera made the following statement in response to construction in the Big Bend region: I have made it very clear that I oppose any construction in the Big Bend area that disturbs the natural landscape and threatens the jobs that tourism brings when non-intrusive technology would do the job. The […] Read More Posted August 12, 2026",
